    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Welcome to number 30 Malachi Road, situated in the ever popular Dublin 7 village of Stoneybatter. This two bedroom cottage has been extended to the rear and retains many original features, while in need of some updating  the property offers an ideal opportunity for those looking to put their own stamp on these much sought after artisan cottages.  Accommodation consists of the living room, dine in kitchen to the rear, full bathroom and two double bedrooms.  There is an East facing patio garden to the rear with plenty of room to relax and dine in the Summer months.  Location could not be better just minutes from the cafes, bars, restaurants and independent shops that Stoneybatter is famous for, an ideal place to spend a lazy weekend.  A further stroll brings you on to Smithfield Village and the City Centre itself. For those who enjoy the outdoors the campus at Grangegorman & the Phoenix Park are also close by.  Great transport links with Dublin Bus cross city services and the Luas at Smithfield all add to the appeal of this property.  Viewing is highly recommended, by appointment only through our Manor Street office.\r\n\r\nLiving Room 4.71m (15'5\") x 3.06m (10'0\")\r\nA spacious living room filled with natural light, original wood flooring & fireplace.\r\n\r\nKitichen 3.69m (12'1\") x 2.92m (9'7\")\r\nExtended to the rear a dine in kitchen with wall & floor mounted units.  Access to the rear yard.\r\n\r\nBathroom 1.58m (5'2\") x 2.98m (9'9\")\r\nFull bathroom with bath/shower combination, WC & WHB.  Tiled surround.\r\n\r\nBedroom 1 3.05m (10'0\") x 2.21m (7'3\")\r\nA double bedroom to the front of the property with original wood flooring.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 3.06m (10'0\") x 2.19m (7'2\")\r\nA second double bedroom with original wood flooring.\r\n\r\nExterior 3.97m (13'0\") x 2m (6'7\")\r\nSpacious East facing patio garden to the rear with decked area.  On street resident`s disc parking to the front.\r\n\r\nArea \r\nApprox 43 Sq Mts /463 Sq Ft"
      },
      {
